  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 56, top: 136, width: 402, height: 480, background: '#121E33', border: '1px solid #22314A', borderRadius: 10, padding: 26 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Consolas'", fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 1.6, color: '#38BDF8', marginBottom: 16 }}>ROOT CAUSE</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E6EDF7', lineHeight: 1.35, marginBottom: 18 }}>
      LLM 的每次
      <br />
      调用互相独立
    </Text>
    <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 17, color: '#9FB0C8', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
      对话历史不会被自动保存。昨天说「买了三盆植物」，今天问「我有几盆」，模型无法回答——除非把原文重新放进输入。
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', paddingTop: 16, borderTop: '1px solid #22314A' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 15, color: '#34D399', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
        目标：把长历史压缩成
        <br />
        小而准的上下文。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 486, top: 136, width: 738, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
    <Box style={{ background: '#121E33', border: '1px solid #22314A', borderRadius: 10, padding: 20 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, marginBottom: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Consolas'", fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#38BDF8' }}>01</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E6EDF7' }}>全上下文：成本</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 16, color: '#9FB0C8', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
        S 档单题 122k token，输入长度与费用成正比；每题重复塞入全部历史的开销不可接受。
      </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ background: '#121E33', border: '1px solid #22314A', borderRadius: 10, padding: 20 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, marginBottom: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Consolas'", fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#38BDF8' }}>02</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E6EDF7' }}>全上下文：噪声</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontFamily: "'Microsoft YaHei'", fontSize: 16, color: '#9FB0C8', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
        S/M 档的干扰会话混进输入，稀释注意力；证据密度在 S 档只有约 0.4%。
      </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ background: '#121E33', border: '1px solid #22314A', borderRadius: 10, padding: 20 }}>
